  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the infinite series $\\frac{1^{2}+2^{2}}{3 !}$ $+\\frac{1^{2}+2^{2}+3^{2}}{4 !}+\\frac{1^{2}+2^{2}+3^{2}+4^{2}}{5 !}+\\ldots$",
